pf-0dbe" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-dQEsWe gFKonE pf-17_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-deXguC bAaQfZ"><div class="sc-feUYzb iXyfoG pf-18_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bJBfJu drQDYO pf-19_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dExXmK Xerjk pf-20_ pf-heading-2-h2">At Russo, Every Day is Earth Day!</h2><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-22_ pf-text-4" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">When you're a part of the green industry, green initiatives are extra important.&nbsp;</p><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-24_ pf-text-4" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>That's why we invest in state-of-the-art, environmentally conscious products from top brands.</b></p><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-26_ pf-text-4" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><a href="#why.flip" target="_self">Why Flip the Switch Away from Fuel</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp;  <a href="#battery.brands" target="_self">Battery-Powered Brands</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;   |&nbsp;&nbsp;   <a href="#faq" target="_self">FAQs</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;   |&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href="#demo" target="_self">Demos</a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-2bb6" data-pf-type="Section" id="why.flip" class="sc-dQEsWe gFKonE pf-28_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1400px" class="sc-deXguC bAaQfZ"><div class="sc-feUYzb iXyfoG pf-29_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:8;--c-lg:8"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bJBfJu drQDYO pf-30_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dExXmK Xerjk pf-31_ pf-heading-3-h3">Why Flip the Switch from&nbsp;Gas to Battery-Powered Landscaping Equipment?</h3><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-33_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Battery-powered landscaping tools are no longer just a trend—they’re the future of the green industry. Industry leaders like STIHL, ECHO, and Husqvarna are driving innovation in electric handheld equipment, while ECHO robotic mowers are reshaping how municipalities and sports fields maintain large properties. On a larger scale, machines like the Mean Green 74" Zero-Turn and the Toro GrandStand Revolution Series are redefining what’s possible for electric commercial mowers.<br><br>Whether you’re managing residential jobs or large-acreage municipal contracts, making the switch to eco-friendly landscaping equipment means cleaner performance, quieter operation, and reduced long-term costs.</p><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dExXmK Xerjk pf-35_ pf-heading-4-h3">Efficient for Your&nbsp;Crew and&nbsp;the Planet</h3><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-37_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Battery-Powered Handheld Tools</b>&nbsp;— No more mixing gas and oil. No more filter replacements. With battery-powered trimmers, blowers, and chainsaws, maintenance becomes minimal—saving you both time and money. For landscaping crews, these tools help improve productivity while reducing emissions and noise on every job.</p><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-39_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Electric Mowers &amp; Compact Loaders</b> — The transition to battery-powered mowers and electric compact loaders is accelerating fast. Brands are providing&nbsp;features like solar charging canopies, swappable battery packs, and full-day run times—making it easier than ever to go green without sacrificing performance. Expect more innovation and options in this category as demand grows.</p><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-41_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b>Robotic Lawn Mowers</b> — When it comes to maintaining parks, athletic fields, or large campuses, robotic mowers are a game-changer. These smart machines operate using GPS navigation and wireless connectivity, letting you mow entire fields with minimal supervision. Adjust mowing schedules, respond to weather delays, and monitor performance—all from your smartphone.</p><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-352_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><b><a href="/pages/battery-advantage" target="_self">Explore the Battery Advantage </a></b>&nbsp; <br>Make the switch to battery-powered landscaping equipment and experience the benefits firsthand—less downtime, lower operating costs, and a cleaner environmental footprint.</p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:4;--c-md:4;--c-lg:4"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bJBfJu drQDYO pf-45_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0691/3340/2417/files/Stihl-battery-trimmer-FSA90R-action.webp?v=1686859567" loading="lazy" width="600" height="450" data-pf-type="Image3" class="sc-dycZeM jfmvQi pf-46_ pf-image-1"/></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-43cd" data-pf-type="Section" id="battery.brands" class="sc-dQEsWe gFKonE pf-47_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-deXguC bAaQfZ"><div class="sc-feUYzb iXyfoG pf-48_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bJBfJu drQDYO pf-49_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dExXmK Xerjk pf-50_ pf-heading-3-h3">Explore our&nbsp;Battery-Powered Brands</h3><p class="sc-iapVNj evXKbL pf-52_ pf-text-4" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We have hand-picked brands that can outfit your entire crew with battery-powered equipment for any task you have!
<br><br>We know that the future of landscaping is battery-powered, and it starts right here at Russo.</p></div></div></div><div class="sc-feUYzb iXyfoG pf-54_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bJBfJu drQDYO pf-55_"><div data-pf-type="Tabs" class="sc-gEkHwe cEvnUT pf-56_"><div data-pf-type="TabsMenu" class="sc-hoMrV gbmXcO pf-57_"><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="true" class="sc-fFlofg bIWses pf-58_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">ECHO</button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-fFlofg bIWses pf-60_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">ECHO Robotics</button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-fFlofg bIWses pf-62_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">Ego</button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-fFlofg bIWses pf-64_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">Husqvarna</button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-fFlofg bIWses pf-66_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">Mean Green</button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-fFlofg bIWses pf-68_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">Toro</button><button type="button" data-pf-tab-active="false" class="sc-fFlofg bIWses pf-70_ pf-anchor" contenteditable="false" data-pf-type="TabHeader2">STIHL</button></div><div data-pf-type="TabContentWrapper" class="sc-bOhtQk fceMLJ pf-72_"><div data-pf-expandable="true" style="display:block" data-pf-type="TabsContent" class="sc-kbdmFF fBGQHp pf-73_"><div class="sc-feUYzb iXyfoG pf-74_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:8;--c-md:8;--c-lg:8"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bJBfJu drQDYO pf-75_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-dExXmK Xerjk